  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are a master of your racial heritage weapons.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Gnome Weapon Focus<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your bonus on attack rolls with “gnome” weapons is increased by 1. If you expend one use of mythic power, you gain a bonus on attack rolls with “gnome” weapons equal to half your tier until the end of your turn. Firearms modified by an experimental gunsmith<sup>ARG</sup> are considered “gnome” weapons for the purpose of this feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc136\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
